{"seq":7,"slug":"cloud-security-compliance","title":"云安全与合规","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.13,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":2}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"云安全与合规-简介\">云安全与合规 简介</h1><p>云安全是云计算体系中最关键也最容易被忽视的领域，它涵盖了从基础设施防护到数据保护、从身份认证到合规审计的完整安全链条。随着企业将核心业务迁移至云端，构建全面的云安全体系已成为技术团队的首要任务。</p>\n<p>本手册面向有云平台使用经验的工程师和安全从业者，系统讲解云安全的核心概念、技术方案和合规框架。读者将学会如何在云环境中实施纵深防御策略，满足安全与合规的双重要求。</p>\n<p>全书共分为四章，从安全基础到合规治理层层递进：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>云安全基础</strong>建立云安全的整体认知框架，讲解共享责任模型的核心理念、云环境面临的威胁态势，以及云安全架构的设计方法。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>身份与访问</strong>深入 IAM 的基础概念与最佳实践，介绍零信任架构的设计理念与落地方法，并讲解密钥和凭证的安全管理策略。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>数据保护</strong>覆盖数据安全的关键技术，从静态数据加密到传输层 TLS 保护，再到数据分类与脱敏的治理策略。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>合规框架</strong>梳理主流合规标准的要求与实施方法，讲解审计日志的设计与合规审计实践，并介绍策略即代码实现自动化合规检查的方法。</p>\n<p>建议读者按章节顺序学习，先建立安全意识和整体架构认知，再深入身份管理和数据保护的技术细节，最后掌握合规治理的系统方法。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-security-fundamentals","title":"云安全基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/cloud-security-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-responsibility","title":"云安全共享责任模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/cloud-security-fundamentals/shared-responsibility"},{"seq":2,"slug":"threat-landscape","title":"云安全威胁全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/cloud-security-fundamentals/threat-landscape"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-architecture","title":"云安全架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/cloud-security-fundamentals/security-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"identity-access","title":"身份与访问","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/identity-access","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"iam-fundamentals","title":"IAM 权限管理基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/identity-access/iam-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"zero-trust","title":"零信任安全模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/identity-access/zero-trust"},{"seq":3,"slug":"secrets-management","title":"密钥与凭证管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/identity-access/secrets-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-protection","title":"数据保护","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/data-protection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"encryption-at-rest","title":"静态数据加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/data-protection/encryption-at-rest"},{"seq":2,"slug":"encryption-in-transit","title":"传输数据加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/data-protection/encryption-in-transit"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-classification","title":"数据分类与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/data-protection/data-classification"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"compliance-frameworks","title":"合规框架","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compliance-overview","title":"合规框架概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/compliance-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"audit-logging","title":"审计日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/audit-logging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compliance-as-code","title":"合规即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/compliance-as-code"},{"seq":4,"slug":"security-audit","title":"安全审计与日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/security-audit"},{"seq":5,"slug":"policy-a